Front End prep/resarch:

# Requirements
 - Take in Xbox input (Input Library)
 - Call API based on Input
 - Display video stream on second window on run

# Controller
- using inputs libary to simply take pad inputs
- Use inputs to communicated with API to send the signals to the car.
- Need to : Decide inputs, test them w/real controller

Example chunk of reading controller input:
>>> from inputs import get_gamepad
>>> while 1:
...     events = get_gamepad()
...     for event in events:
...         print(event.ev_type, event.code, event.state)

link to docs: https://inputs.readthedocs.io/en/latest/user/quickstart.html
